  "body": "Situated in the quiet, family focused suburb of Orewa, 41A Kikorangi offers sleek modern living designed for busy families who want comfort without the upkeep. Set on a 320m² (approx.) freehold section with a 207m² (approx.) well designed interior, this home delivers a practical layout, premium finishes, and effortless move in readiness.\r\n\r\nStep inside to a bright, welcoming home where natural light fills the open plan kitchen, dining and lounge. The low maintenance cladding and landscaped garden ensure you spend more time enjoying your home and less time maintaining it.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n* 4 generous bedrooms, 2 bathrooms + separate guest toilet\r\n* The master bedroom enjoys open views, a huge walk in wardrobe, and a cosy reading corner\r\n* One upstairs bedroom offers a lovely sea view\r\n* 2 car tandem garage for secure parking and extra storage\r\n* Central air conditioning for year round comfort\r\n* Remaining Master Build Warranty for peace of mind\r\n\r\nLocated in the safe, friendly Ara Hills community, this home is close to local parks, schools, and reserves. A short drive connects you to Orewa/Silverdale Shopping Centre, cafés, and major motorway links - making commutes simple and stress free. Here, you'll enjoy the perfect balance of quiet suburban living with full urban convenience.\r\n\r\nCall Team Vinson and Amy 022 571 7074 now to book your viewing. For more information, and find all you need please visit https://www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
